  "id": "empyreumatic",
  "term": "empyreumatic",
  "definition": "In this packet, empyreumatic refers to a form of Sophora alopecuroides oil made by vacuum distillation. The term is used here as part of the name of a plant-derived oil that has been used traditionally for skin conditions such as eczema, psoriasis vulgaris, and neurodermatitis.",
